# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release-archive filters — `git archive` honors `export-ignore`.
#
# The files below are dev-only reproduction / verification harnesses: they stay
# in the repository (they are how real defects get reproduced) but they are not
# part of a source release, because they write into the developer's scratch
# directories and reference nothing the shipped build needs.
#
# release-archive.sh archives with `--worktree-attributes`, so these rules also
# apply when packaging an older tag whose tree predates this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/packages/dsh-tui-app/repro-*.mjs       export-ignore
/packages/dsh-tui-app/verify-fixes.mjs  export-ignore
